ithub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113070","id":3567937301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UqmcV","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T13:06:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T13:06:25Z","body":"I realized a major flaw in EditorDockManager. `closed_dock_parent` is not invisible. If it was, this problem wouldn't exist and the order of making things invisible wouldn't matter, because nodes reparented to closed dock parent couldn't become visible. We should still hide them though, so `is_visible()` is false.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567937301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3570404146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113070#issuecomment-3570404146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113070","id":3570404146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U0Asy","user":{"login":"lo